      </figure>
      <div class="proto-authors__copy reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Authors</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="authors-title">Before they became cards</h2>
        <p class="body-copy">
          Vasily Pochitsky painted the cycle. Alexander Zhilchik shaped the world. Fifty-four
